---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="manifesto section--tight" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="manifesto__grid">
      <aside class="manifesto__aside">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>OUR DIMENSION / 00</p>
        <p class="manifesto__note" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: .08s">
          山东省济钢高级中学（全福校区） · 跨次元新星动漫社<br />
          一个因热爱动画而相遇的学生创作社团
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/about/" data-nav-link data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: .16s">
          <span class="text-link__line">关于我们</span>
          <Icon name="arrowUpRight" size={13} />
        </a>
      </aside>

      <div class="manifesto__main">
        <h2 class="manifesto__title" id="manifesto-title" data-reveal>
          我们在画格之间，<br />
          收集<span class="manifesto__italic">尚未命名</span>的次元。
        </h2>

        <div class="manifesto__lower">
          <p class="manifesto__lead" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: .1s">
            从一幅画的空气感，到一篇小说的呼吸，再到一束穿过放映机的光。我们相信，喜欢本身就已经是一种创作——而作品，是它留下的回声。
          </p>

          <div class="manifesto__stats" data-reveal-group>
            <div class="manifesto__stat">
              <span class="manifesto__number">12<sup>+</sup></span>
              <span class="manifesto__label">位同学<br />表达入社意愿</span>
            </div>
            <div class="manifesto__stat">
              <span class="manifesto__number">03</span>
              <span class="manifesto__label">创作方向<br />插画 / 小说 / 影像</span>
            </div>
            <div class="manifesto__stat">
              <span class="manifesto__number manifesto__number--inf">∞</span>
              <span class="manifesto__label">次元之间<br />想象的可能</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .manifesto::after {
    content: "✦";
    position: absolute;
    top: 6%;
    right: 4%;
    font-size: clamp(60px, 10vw, 150px);
    line-height: 1;
    color: rgba(243, 238, 227, 0.035);
    transform: rotate(12deg);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .manifesto__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(200px, 0.42fr) minmax(0, 1.58fr);
    gap: clamp(40px, 8vw, 140px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .manifesto__aside {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 28px;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  .manifesto__note {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .manifesto__aside .text-link {
    justify-self: start;
  }

  .manifesto__title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.9vw, 78px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.28;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .manifesto__italic {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    padding-right: 0.08em;
  }

  .manifesto__lower {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
    gap: clamp(40px, 7vw, 110px);
    align-items: end;
    margin-top: clamp(44px, 6vw, 90px);
    padding-top: clamp(30px, 4vw, 54px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .manifesto__lead {
    max-width: 34em;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 2.1;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .manifesto__stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .manifesto__stat {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-left: 18px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .manifesto__number {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(42px, 4.2vw, 68px);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .manifesto__number sup {
    font-size: 0.38em;
    color: var(--accent);
    vertical-align: super;
  }

  .manifesto__number--inf {
    color: var(--accent-warm);
  }

  .manifesto__label {
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .manifesto__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .manifesto__aside {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .manifesto__aside .eyebrow {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
    .manifesto__note {
      font-size: 11px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .manifesto__lower {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }
    .manifesto__stats {
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .manifesto__stat {
      padding-left: 12px;
    }
    .manifesto__label {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .manifesto__aside {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .manifesto__stats {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
    .manifesto__number {
      font-size: 38px;
    }
  }
</style>
